# Image slots for the About page (components/about).
#
# Drop files here with these exact names and they replace the labelled
# placeholders automatically — no code change needed.
#
#   hero.webp                16:9   page hero
#   mission.webp              3:4   mission band (4:3 on mobile)
#   vision.webp              16:9   vision band
#   service-showroom.webp     4:3
#   service-product.webp      4:3
#   service-realestate.webp   4:3
#   service-automotive.webp   4:3
#   service-jewelry.webp      4:3
#   service-tryon.webp        4:3
#   service-events.webp       4:3
#   service-booking.webp      4:3
#
# NOTE next.config.mjs serves /images/* with Cache-Control: immutable,
# max-age=31536000. Replacing a file AFTER it has been served needs a
# filename bump — browsers will not revalidate it for a year.
